1. 创建一个名为 `manifest.json` 的文件，内容如下：

```json
{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Custom Pricing Extension",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "Adjust prices based on user's gender, income level, and race from Amazon profile.",
  "permissions": [
    "activeTab",
    "https://www.amazon.com/*"
  ],
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "background.js"
  },
  "action": {
    "default_popup": "popup.html"
  }
}
